{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03833","headline":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣官乐游园宴 · 宋璟","name":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣官乐游园宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"侍饮终酺会，承恩续胜游。\n戴天惟庆幸，选地即殊尤。\n北向祗双阙，南临赏一丘。\n曲江新溜暖，上苑杂花稠。\n亹亹韶弦屡，戋戋贲帛周。\n醉归填畛陌，荣耀接轩裘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋璟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03833.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03833","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}